	<h2>What this is about</h2>
	<p>
		This website is a private fan page about the Mitsubishi Pajero. It uses no
		cookies, no analytics or tracking services, and no advertising networks. There
		are no user accounts, no forms and no comment section — so no personal data is
		actively collected.
	</p>

	<h2>Server log files</h2>
	<p>
		The site is hosted on Microsoft Azure (Microsoft Ireland Operations Ltd., West
		Europe region/Netherlands). When you visit the site, the server necessarily
		processes connection data (IP address, date and time of access, requested page,
		browser type). This data is required to deliver the website and keep it secure
		(Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR), is not combined with other data, and is deleted
		automatically after a short period.
	</p>

	<h2>Fonts</h2>
	<p>
		For consistent typography the site loads fonts from Google Fonts. Your browser
		fetches the font files from servers operated by Google (Google Ireland Ltd.),
		which means Google receives your device's IP address. The legal basis is our
		legitimate interest in a consistent presentation (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). For more
		information see
		<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights</h2>
	<p>
		Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction
		of processing, data portability and objection. To exercise these rights, contact
		the email address above. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a
		data protection supervisory authority.
	</p>
</div>
